    tr\u01B0\u1EDFng Kim \u0110an H\u1EADu K\u1EF3... m\xE0 th\xF4i!"
  - "G\u1EA7n \"Kim H\u1ED3ng Ki\u1EBFm Ph\xE1i\", G\u1EA7n \"Tr\xFAc S\u01A1n T\xF4ng\",
